    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch09-19: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.37";
    dc:description "Computation can test a restricted mechanistic association, but not the claim about the universe's ultimate rules. Discriminating the proposed cause of three-dimensionality requires both sharper theory and new empirical access.";
