    dc:type "resolution-route/mixed";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Across a defined ensemble of network rules, quantify local randomness and large-scale volume-growth dimension, testing whether robust dimension three occurs specifically because of randomness. Physical support would additionally require signatures linking the successful ensemble to observed spacetime.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Existing observations do not access the microscopic network.", "No canonical rule ensemble or randomness metric.", "Simulation can show correlation but not that nature uses the mechanism.";
